  "details": "A couple of years ago it was possible to take 360° stereo images using the camera in VRchat. \n\nThose pictures are incredibly immersive and super cool and can still be seen in a few worlds such as the old 2017 hub, by stepping into the \"panosphere\"! \n\nUnfortunately the functionality to take those images is no longer available. \n\nI would love for the VRchat team to bring back this awesome feature!",
